    "detailed_description": "Marianna is a sea witch capable of powerful magic and mystical alchemy, which she only uses to help people. When Princess Cassandra visits her with a request to find out why her fianc\u00e9 was acting so strange and why he left, Marianna takes the case, only to discover that she might have more of a connection to the culprit than she realized! Join Marianna on a dangerous journey to untangle the tale of the siren\u2019s song and discover who is really behind this mind-bending mystery in this magical Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a special Collector's Edition release full of exclusive extras you won\u2019t find in the standard version. As a bonus, Collector's Edition purchases count toward three stamps on your Monthly Game Club Punch Card!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure game, meaning a specific genre of story-driven, point &amp; click adventures. Throughout the game, players are tasked to find a list of objects hidden within a particular scene, and to occasionally complete various mini-games/puzzles.  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Collector\u2019s Edition includes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022\tCapture mischievous creatures to save a wedding in the bonus game!<br />\r\n\u2022\tFollow the clues with the strategy guide!<br />\r\n\u2022\tCollect special cards and shells to unlock puzzle pieces in the secret room!<br />\r\n\u2022\tEnjoy exclusive wallpapers, screensavers, music, and more!",
